# Annotation sheets carry verbatim paragraph text and headlines from the
# licensed pilot corpus. Same rule as corpus: the text
# stays on the machine, only the instruments and the split record are tracked.
# The split is recoverable from split-assignment.json, which records immutable corpus
# versions keyed by the identity triple (article_id, paragraph_id, sha256) plus an
# append-only assignment log. The seed no longer determines membership.
# and each paragraph carries a text_sha256 for verification.
sheets/

# Quarantined files: model-prefilled sheets and anything else that must not
# reach the annotation flow. Kept on the machine, never committed.
_quarantine/
# The coder's free-text notes of schema-2 sessions: may quote licensed text.
labels/private/
